WEBVTT

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:09.490
Hey.

00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:13.000
Megumi?

00:00:15.810 --> 00:00:16.710
This...

00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:19.910
is my parents' house.

00:00:26.350 --> 00:00:32.190
Oh ware izukoe
Oh, where am I?

00:00:32.190 --> 00:00:38.330
Oh ware yobukoe
Oh, the voice that's calling me

00:00:38.730 --> 00:00:41.530
umetsukusu jouhou
Immersing information

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:46.070
ikigurushii kono joukyou
This suffocating situation

00:00:46.070 --> 00:00:49.340
jibun ga inai
I'm not here

00:00:50.110 --> 00:00:53.350
kono sekai no bousou
The world is going out of control

00:00:53.350 --> 00:00:57.690
tada musekinin ni toubou
Run away irresponsibly

00:00:57.690 --> 00:01:00.820
dokoe ikuno
Where am I going?

00:01:00.820 --> 00:01:03.320
Huriyamanu ameni
The never-ending rain

00:01:03.320 --> 00:01:07.160
zubunure oitekareta kokoro ga
Soak the neglected heart

00:01:07.160 --> 00:01:12.170
kuzure yuku chokuzen no koe wo kike
Listen to the voices before it collapses

00:01:12.170 --> 00:01:18.010
sasayakana kizunade ii
I'm fine with the subtle connection

00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:23.880
sotto anata wo dakishimeru kara
I will hold you gently

00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:35.460
kasaneta inochi ga
yukkurito ima kokyuu shite iru
The overlapped souls breathe slowly

00:01:35.460 --> 00:01:39.160
sobani iruyo
"I'll be by your side."

00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:44.970
Oh ware izukoe
Oh, where am I?

00:01:44.970 --> 00:01:50.870
Oh ware yobukoe
Oh, the voice that's calling me

00:01:53.010 --> 00:01:55.070
Oral Medicine

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:02.480
Thanks, Kayano.

00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:03.650
You saved us.

00:02:05.150 --> 00:02:05.880
It's nothing.

00:02:09.460 --> 00:02:11.250
Why did you come, Jun?

00:02:14.700 --> 00:02:17.490
Thank you very much for coming so late, doctor.

00:02:21.300 --> 00:02:24.830
Why didn't she want us to call the ambulance?

00:02:25.440 --> 00:02:26.270
Yeah...

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:34.540
Thank you... um... well...

00:02:35.480 --> 00:02:38.620
Michiyo, tidy the room upstairs for them.

00:02:38.620 --> 00:02:40.590
I-I can do it.

00:02:49.160 --> 00:02:54.730
I get that normal humans are useless
in battle between Persona users.

00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:56.630
However...

00:03:01.940 --> 00:03:06.010
You said something like this happened before?

00:03:06.010 --> 00:03:09.610
Perhaps you used to own a powerful Persona, too.

00:03:11.390 --> 00:03:17.430
The Marebito are expanding their
power due to their dire circumstances.

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:25.090
A person who doesn't carry a Persona would
fall into apathy when exposed to such power.

00:03:25.870 --> 00:03:27.890
It's the same logic as Shadow Extraction.

00:03:32.240 --> 00:03:36.770
Counselor... What are you
planning to do in the end?

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:39.510
What are we exactly?

00:03:39.510 --> 00:03:41.570
Someone has to end this.

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:48.920
I will be responsible for involving
children and everyone else.

00:04:26.790 --> 00:04:30.230
Look at them. We prepared
beds upstairs and everything.

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:35.660
I'm sure they're tired from
fighting with their Personas.

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:38.060
I bet it was frightening.

00:04:39.740 --> 00:04:43.010
Why did all this happen?

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:46.740
By the way, why are you?

00:04:50.820 --> 00:04:52.910
I'll tell you everything later.

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:54.120
Sure.

00:04:54.760 --> 00:04:57.380
Thanks for joining us, Megumi-chan.

00:04:59.260 --> 00:05:01.790
Do you not have faith in your Persona?

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:10.330
It's true there are some Personas
that try to kill their owners.

00:05:11.310 --> 00:05:16.180
But your Persona tried to help
Tasaka Yumi-san together with you.

00:05:16.180 --> 00:05:18.150
But... senpai was...

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:22.280
That wasn't your fault.

00:06:45.270 --> 00:06:46.530
You scared me.

00:06:48.040 --> 00:06:49.530
I can't sleep.

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:54.010
The Wind Bon Festival...

00:06:54.380 --> 00:06:56.340
I thought he might come back and visit.

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:04.750
You're not gonna ask?

00:07:06.490 --> 00:07:08.520
Don't you think it's weird?

00:07:08.520 --> 00:07:11.530
A group of us suddenly bothering you at night,

00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:14.960
telling you not to call the ambulance
even though someone's injured?

00:07:16.260 --> 00:07:17.390
He told me not to ask.

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:19.560
Your father.

00:07:20.740 --> 00:07:24.030
I'm in no position to ask, right?

00:07:45.030 --> 00:07:48.020
I can't take it back once I've offered.

00:07:50.470 --> 00:07:51.990
How is he?

00:07:52.070 --> 00:07:53.290
The boy with the injury.

00:07:53.800 --> 00:07:54.890
He's asleep.

00:07:55.370 --> 00:07:56.060
I see.

00:07:56.940 --> 00:07:58.340
He would be about the same age...

00:07:59.810 --> 00:08:01.540
If Tomoya were alive.

00:08:40.050 --> 00:08:41.280
Inui-sa-

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:45.610
Sh-should I wake him up?

00:08:51.330 --> 00:08:52.660
It's okay.

00:08:53.230 --> 00:08:54.400
Jun-kun?

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:56.390
There are no Personas around.

00:09:01.840 --> 00:09:04.200
Kanzato-kun, Jun-kun is up.

00:09:04.410 --> 00:09:06.370
It's fine. Let him sleep.

00:09:06.470 --> 00:09:07.700
All right.

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:10.410
Do you want some?

00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:16.470
So you had one... A brother.

00:09:17.150 --> 00:09:18.950
What? What made you say that?

00:09:19.390 --> 00:09:22.520
Oh, um... I saw his picture.

00:09:23.820 --> 00:09:25.260
When did you see it?

00:09:25.260 --> 00:09:26.280
Um... a second ago.

00:09:28.260 --> 00:09:29.020
Oh... I see.

00:10:33.090 --> 00:10:34.190
Mom?

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:50.570
Mom...

00:11:03.720 --> 00:11:05.060
Why!?

00:11:05.530 --> 00:11:07.990
Why couldn't it be you!?

00:11:11.730 --> 00:11:13.670
My stepmom's real son...

00:11:14.570 --> 00:11:16.430
Died because of me...

00:11:19.840 --> 00:11:21.900
It's not something you could've helped.

00:11:27.480 --> 00:11:29.450
I want you to...

00:11:29.450 --> 00:11:31.510
What if it's something I can't do?

00:11:32.020 --> 00:11:33.450
I tried hard...

00:11:34.660 --> 00:11:38.890
Can I give up, if it's something I
tried so hard at, but couldn't do?

00:11:40.330 --> 00:11:42.850
I tried to tell myself I could.

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:47.160
I kept repeating that I did the best I could...

00:11:48.200 --> 00:11:49.940
I wanted to think so.

00:11:49.940 --> 00:11:53.430
But... I actually...

00:11:54.780 --> 00:11:56.040
Megumi-san...

00:11:56.940 --> 00:12:00.180
I didn't like my stepbrother.

00:12:00.180 --> 00:12:05.450
I was jealous Mom only cared about him.

00:12:07.020 --> 00:12:08.110
It's okay.

00:12:09.390 --> 00:12:13.160
What if it was something I... didn't
do, not something I... couldn't do?

00:12:15.260 --> 00:12:17.990
The thought of it scares me.

00:12:18.930 --> 00:12:20.030
Megumi-san...

00:12:20.840 --> 00:12:22.700
It really scares me.

00:12:39.220 --> 00:12:40.210
How beautiful.

00:12:42.320 --> 00:12:43.810
It's from when I was younger.

00:12:44.630 --> 00:12:46.650
That's why Megumi-san likes to dance...

00:12:48.330 --> 00:12:51.390
She's in a dance club at school.

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:53.490
I see.

00:13:05.880 --> 00:13:07.210
Yo.

00:13:07.210 --> 00:13:08.940
Oh, m-morning.

00:13:09.120 --> 00:13:11.550
Sanada-san and the others are heading out.

00:13:11.790 --> 00:13:13.550
Shouldn't we go with them?

00:13:14.420 --> 00:13:16.250
They told us to stay by Jun.

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:20.060
He's already up. Shouldn't
we take him to the hospital?

00:13:20.060 --> 00:13:23.930
Yeah. His treatment last night
was just a temporary measure.

00:13:23.930 --> 00:13:25.400
What about Kanzato-kun?

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:27.630
He's still asleep.

00:13:38.510 --> 00:13:40.670
You both should leave this place soon.

00:13:41.220 --> 00:13:43.050
Stay away from me.

00:13:56.200 --> 00:13:58.390
Why did you have to come back?

00:14:16.150 --> 00:14:20.640
Directions? Just cross the
river and go straight down.

00:14:21.460 --> 00:14:23.720
Speaking of, they do look alike.

00:14:24.760 --> 00:14:25.950
Kanzato-kun!

00:14:27.530 --> 00:14:28.600
Where's Jun?

00:14:28.600 --> 00:14:30.560
At a hospital in the nearby city.

00:14:31.400 --> 00:14:33.030
This is really good.

00:14:33.030 --> 00:14:33.690
Thanks...

00:14:34.940 --> 00:14:35.990
I'm gonna go.

00:14:36.800 --> 00:14:37.960
To the hospital.

00:14:38.270 --> 00:14:40.100
I have to be by him.

00:14:40.240 --> 00:14:42.210
But, everyone else is with him.

00:14:42.210 --> 00:14:44.350
There's a bicycle in the back.

00:14:44.350 --> 00:14:45.740
May I borrow it?

00:14:46.050 --> 00:14:47.010
The directions!

00:14:47.010 --> 00:14:47.840
I'll ask on the way!

00:14:50.020 --> 00:14:52.010
He must be very worried.

00:14:52.250 --> 00:14:54.520
Siblings are so nice.

00:14:54.760 --> 00:14:56.350
Are you an only child?

00:14:56.860 --> 00:15:01.090
Yes. I grew up in an orphanage and was adopted.

00:15:01.700 --> 00:15:03.930
I don't know much about my real family.

00:15:04.330 --> 00:15:05.360
Is that right?

00:15:08.940 --> 00:15:13.400
I envy Megumi-san for growing
up in such a wonderful city.

00:15:13.640 --> 00:15:18.080
Actually, she's not related to her mother either.

00:15:19.350 --> 00:15:21.140
Because of me, she...

00:15:23.020 --> 00:15:28.280
But I can sense some connection
between Megumi-san and her mother.

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:31.480
Thanks.

00:15:41.800 --> 00:15:44.170
I heard... you're dancing, too...

00:15:44.610 --> 00:15:48.410
Yeah, but it's more like street dancing...

00:15:48.740 --> 00:15:50.070
It's completely different.

00:15:51.150 --> 00:15:55.740
Well, we performed on the
street, too. Same thing, right?

00:16:04.660 --> 00:16:08.090
I said I'd teach you more, and I never did.

00:16:09.300 --> 00:16:11.320
If only that accident didn't happen...

00:16:12.170 --> 00:16:15.400
There's nothing I can say to make things better.

00:16:21.340 --> 00:16:24.740
I know I can't take back what I said...

00:16:38.930 --> 00:16:40.420
Shiiba? You're alive?

00:16:40.760 --> 00:16:41.560
Yeah...

00:16:41.900 --> 00:16:43.360
I was worried.

00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:46.320
Where are you now?

00:16:47.100 --> 00:16:48.830
Outside town, I think.

00:16:49.570 --> 00:16:51.160
Can you make it back alone?

00:16:51.970 --> 00:16:55.840
We were looking for an
ambulance until this morning.

00:16:56.440 --> 00:16:59.340
To capture Kanzato Shin's little brother.

00:17:00.010 --> 00:17:02.540
That thing is pretty amazing, Shiiba.

00:17:15.900 --> 00:17:17.920
What's the matter, Jun!? Does it hurt?

00:17:18.170 --> 00:17:19.030
Inui-san!

00:18:01.910 --> 00:18:04.400
What if you end up hurting someone that way?

00:18:14.490 --> 00:18:15.510
Where's Mom?

00:18:18.890 --> 00:18:19.880
Mo-

00:18:27.670 --> 00:18:28.570
No!

00:19:01.400 --> 00:19:02.300
Mom...

00:19:02.800 --> 00:19:03.700
Megumi...

00:19:05.640 --> 00:19:06.770
Where's everyone?

00:19:13.510 --> 00:19:15.000
Was it you?

00:19:16.750 --> 00:19:17.940
Back then, too?

00:19:20.550 --> 00:19:23.550
The one who saved us?

00:19:27.900 --> 00:19:29.890
So it's true...

00:19:41.140 --> 00:19:42.740
Thank you for taking care of us.

00:19:42.740 --> 00:19:44.470
Thank you very much.

00:19:45.480 --> 00:19:47.410
Jun, are you ready yet?

00:19:47.410 --> 00:19:49.440
Megumi, hurry up.

00:19:49.780 --> 00:19:51.050
Coming!

00:19:51.390 --> 00:19:52.370
Megumi...

00:19:54.220 --> 00:19:55.050
Here.

00:19:55.590 --> 00:19:56.780
For your trip back...

00:19:59.790 --> 00:20:01.390
Will you accept it?

00:20:08.100 --> 00:20:09.030
Thank you.

00:20:15.110 --> 00:20:18.740
Um... Don't worry too much. About what you said...

00:20:19.550 --> 00:20:23.480
I think I can appreciate that you said it.

00:20:24.080 --> 00:20:25.180
Otherwise...

00:20:25.590 --> 00:20:28.710
If no one reproached me... I...

00:20:33.130 --> 00:20:38.000
Don't be stupid. You did the best you could.

00:20:39.630 --> 00:20:42.000
Come back... anytime.

00:21:01.760 --> 00:21:05.780
Niichan... I'm sorry for everything.

00:21:14.840 --> 00:21:16.000
Really?

00:21:16.740 --> 00:21:18.170
I'm serious!

00:21:19.340 --> 00:21:24.000
I'm not sure, but everything's fine now, right?

00:21:24.680 --> 00:21:25.870
What? What is?

00:21:27.710 --> 00:21:30.480
Here. It's good.

00:21:53.410 --> 00:21:58.410
Itsukara yume miru koto
When did I start pretending
like I didn't dream of anything?

00:21:58.410 --> 00:22:04.550
Wasureta huri wo shitetan darou
When did I start pretending
like I didn't dream of anything?

00:22:04.550 --> 00:22:11.060
Chiisana mado akeru yuuki mo naku
With no courage to open a small
window, I waited for a miracle.

00:22:11.060 --> 00:22:16.130
Kiseki wo matteta
With no courage to open a small
window, I waited for a miracle.

00:22:16.130 --> 00:22:26.410
Ushinau mono nado nakatta anohi no yona
I'm not as innocent as I used to be in
the days when I had nothing to lose

00:22:26.410 --> 00:22:31.850
mujakisa wa mou naikedo
I'm not as innocent as I used to be in
the days when I had nothing to lose

00:22:31.850 --> 00:22:38.050
namida wo nugutta ato niwa
After wiping away the tears

00:22:38.050 --> 00:22:43.990
atarashii jibun ni deaeru
I'll be able to meet a new self

00:22:43.990 --> 00:22:47.930
subete wo nakushitemo
mitsuke rareru monoga arukara
Even if I lose everything

00:22:47.930 --> 00:22:54.130
subete wo nakushitemo
mitsuke rareru monoga arukara
There are still some things to discover

00:22:54.130 --> 00:22:59.870
kesenai kizumo itsuka
Even the scars that remain

00:22:59.870 --> 00:23:06.900
watashi rashii hokori ni dekiru
will someday become my pride

00:23:12.620 --> 00:23:14.550
It was painful.

00:23:14.550 --> 00:23:16.620
It was agonizing.

00:23:16.620 --> 00:23:20.390
But I endured it just for him.

00:23:20.390 --> 00:23:24.900
A tiny witch was born.

00:23:24.900 --> 00:23:27.170
Me, at a halted state.

00:23:27.170 --> 00:23:29.340
Me, all grown up.

00:23:29.340 --> 00:23:32.810
Me, who is here but not here.

00:23:32.810 --> 00:23:35.140
The whale is unwilling.

00:23:35.140 --> 00:23:37.340
If she grows lonely,

00:23:37.340 --> 00:23:39.780
another one will be gone.
